      "solution": "import numpy as np\n\n\ndef least_squares(xs, ys):\n    x = np.array(xs, dtype=float)\n    y = np.array(ys, dtype=float)\n    w = ((x - x.mean()) * (y - y.mean())).sum() / ((x - x.mean()) ** 2).sum()\n    b = y.mean() - w * x.mean()\n    return [round(float(w), 4), round(float(b), 4)]\n",
